stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "🌳 full" as full
    state "🌱 lite" as lite
    state "🔥 ultra" as ultra
    state "⏸️ off" as off
    [*] --> full: the saved default
    full --> lite: /lean lite
    lite --> full: /lean full
    full --> ultra: /lean ultra
    ultra --> full: /lean full
    full --> off: /lean off
    off --> full: /lean on
    note right of lite
        only a prompt that is the whole command counts
    end note
    note right of ultra
        an unknown option such as /lean extreme changes nothing
    end note
    note right of off
        the next prompt tells the model the rules no longer apply
    end note
